ID: harness
Category: harness
Check: isolation__left_no_trace

wt --version removes slot app-wt1 from the pool, outside the run folder, as a wt rm or wt free
that reached the real pool would. git worktree remove moves no ref and writes no reflog.
Machine specific: the path is a fake pool under the verifier's temporary HOME, never the real pool.

